The doomsday repository got hyped on GitHub - the most useful collection for today

Inside are all the survival tools:
- A completely independent computer system that works without the internet, with AI, Wiki, and maps;
- Everything works locally - no clouds or data transmission;
- Installs with ONE command and is managed through a browser;
- Accessible from ANY device on the same network.

Get it — here.

